# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for one-off runs (not a house gate).
# The CUDA driver serializes its own internal state with locks TSan cannot
# model; concurrent kernel launches from different threads surface as
# memintrinsics races inside libcuda. The runtime API is thread-safe by
# contract — these are instrumentation blind spots, not product races.
race:libcuda.so
race:libcudart.so
race:libnvidia-ml.so
